[{"version":"Unreleased","sections":[{"heading":[{"kind":"text","text":"Reviewed corrections for site-only phrases (#999)"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"content":[{"kind":"text","text":"Site phrases with no package message had no correction path, so wrong-sense machine translations stayed. They are now corrected in a reviewed list, "},{"kind":"code","text":"scripts/site-phrase-corrections.mjs"},{"kind":"text","text":", which the generator applies after the package labels. It holds 68 Chinese and 66 Korean entries, for example \"Components\" ("},{"kind":"code","text":"成分"},{"kind":"text","text":", \"ingredients\", now "},{"kind":"code","text":"组件"},{"kind":"text","text":"), \"Slug\" ("},{"kind":"code","text":"蛞蝓"},{"kind":"text","text":", the animal, now "},{"kind":"code","text":"别名"},{"kind":"text","text":"), \"Browse\" ("},{"kind":"code","text":"먹다"},{"kind":"text","text":", \"eat\", now "},{"kind":"code","text":"둘러보기"},{"kind":"text","text":") and \"Lists\" ("},{"kind":"code","text":"기울기"},{"kind":"text","text":", \"slope\", now "},{"kind":"code","text":"목록"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}]},{"content":[{"kind":"code","text":"verify-site-phrase-translations.mjs"},{"kind":"text","text":" fails when a site pack does not carry a correction, or when a correction names a phrase the site no longer uses. A unit test rejects a correction for a label a package message translates."}]},{"content":[{"kind":"text","text":"Package corrections: \"Explore\" (editorial card) in Arabic ("},{"kind":"code","text":"يستكشف"},{"kind":"text","text":" → "},{"kind":"code","text":"استكشف"},{"kind":"text","text":"), Hebrew (→ "},{"kind":"code","text":"גלו"},{"kind":"text","text":"), Italian (Esplorare → Esplora) and Japanese ("},{"kind":"code","text":"探検する"},{"kind":"text","text":" → "},{"kind":"code","text":"詳しく見る"},{"kind":"text","text":"); Arabic \"Code\" ("},{"kind":"code","text":"شفرة"},{"kind":"text","text":", \"cipher\" → "},{"kind":"code","text":"الكود"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}]}]}]}]}]
